            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 14.30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno jo pa Juda gubino bot Yocwa i Gilgal, ci Kaleb wod pe Jepune ma jo Keniji owaco bote ni, “In iŋeyo gin ma yam Rwot ociko bot Moses ma dano pa Lubaŋa-ni, ma ociko ki i Kadec-bamea, lok ma dok i komi ki i koma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.13.1+NUM.13.2+NUM.13.3+NUM.13.4+NUM.13.5+NUM.13.6+NUM.13.7+NUM.13.8+NUM.13.9+NUM.13.10+NUM.13.11+NUM.13.12+NUM.13.13+NUM.13.14+NUM.13.15+NUM.13.16+NUM.13.17+NUM.13.18+NUM.13.19+NUM.13.20+NUM.13.21+NUM.13.22+NUM.13.23+NUM.13.24+NUM.13.25+NUM.13.26+NUM.13.27+NUM.13.28+NUM.13.29+NUM.13.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 13.1-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onoŋo doŋ mwaka me ditta romo pyeraŋwen i kare ma Moses latic pa Lubaŋa ocwala ki i Kadec-bamea pi roto lobo, ci adwogo ki lok kit ma yam tye kwede i cwinya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utmegiwa ma yam gucito kweda-ni gumiyo cwiny lwak oŋabbe aŋaba, ento an yam alubo gin ma Rwot Lubaŋana mito ducu kikore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 14.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses okwoŋo kwoŋ i nino meno kun wacci, ‘Adada, lobo ma yam inyono ki tyeni bibedo ginaleyani ki pa likwayi matwal, pien ibedo ka lubo gin ma Rwot Lubaŋana omito ki cwinyi ducu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kombeddi nen ka Rwot pud ogwoka atye makwo wa onyoo kit ma yam owaco-ni, odoko doŋ mwaka pyeraŋwen wiye abic a kwede wa i kare ca ma Rwot owaco iye lok man bot Moses, ma onoŋo jo Icrael pud gitye ka wirre i tim kuca; kombeddi doŋ inen, mwaka me ditta doŋ oromo pyeraboro wiye abic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento koma pud tek wa i kare man ma rom ki i kare ma yam Moses ocwala kwede ca; i kare-ni tek koma pud rom ki tek koma macon ca, pud aromo lweny, aromo cito ka mo-ni ci adwogo bene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pienno miya lobo-ni ma bedo lobo godi, ma yam Rwot owaco pire i kare ca. Yam iwinyo i kare meno ni jo Anak gitye kunnu kun gitye ki cog gaŋigi madito ma girumogi woko ki cel matego; ka gwok nyo Rwot bibedo kweda ci abiryemogi woko kit macalo Rwot yam owaco.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yocwa olamo gum i kome, ci omiyo Kebron bot Kaleb wod pa Jepune wek obed ginaleyane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno Kebron odoko ginaleya pa likwayo pa Kaleb wod pa Jepune ma jo Keniji o wa onyoo, pien obedo ka lubo gin ma Rwot Lubaŋa pa Icrael mito ducu kikore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyiŋ Kebron okwoŋo bedo Kiriat-arba, dok Arba meno yam obedo dano madit makato ducu ki i kin jo Anak. Ci lobo doŋ oywe, lweny obedo pe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
